WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,300
How to sell meat

2
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:15,140
Don’t let it float for one dollar and a pound, I want it.

3
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:25,360
Good start

4
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,460
That's almost it

5
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,060
It should be eye-catching if it continues to be sold.

6
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:56,160
Little brother, business is good. Don’t get me wrong if something happens.

7
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,160
I see that all you produce is good wild boar meat.

8
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,360
I want to ask if there will be more in the future
